  (text "08 Semtech SX1262 (DC-DC, 32 MHz crystal), PE4259 switch, U.FL" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 7.62 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "76a9f374-36bb-5d85-aaca-09852c45b643"))
  (text "A2: RF network redrawn to the Semtech E449V01A / E428V03A reference topology (same RF values in both 902-928 MHz boards) with the reference BOM values as STARTING values." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 13.97 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "9a2da081-217d-5afe-873d-b3dcb938ce84"))
  (text "*** The values were tuned by Semtech on a 1.0 mm stack (0.15 mm L1-L2). On JLC04161H-3313 they must be re-tuned on a VNA and pass conducted TX power/harmonic/RX tests (AGENTS rule 5). Not validated. ***" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 16.51 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "a4c6c911-35eb-5d4a-b0f4-0a90d39ae715"))
  (text "Crystal (E428-type) kept by the lowest-cost criterion: NDK NX2016SA 32 MHz EXS00A-CS06465 (CL 10 pF, +/-10 ppm). TCXO (E449) is the owner option if long-airtime plans are used; DIO3 left open." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 19.05 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "a82d9021-ca50-5009-84ce-eadbc30a2c31"))
  (text "PE4259 single-pin mode: pin 6 = VDD through R72/R74 divider (about 3.09 V; pSemi operating range is 1.8-3.3 V and 3V3_MAIN can exceed 3.3 V with tolerance). DIO2 = 1 in TX selects RF1. No TX before a regional configuration (AGENTS rule 14)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 21.59 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "f2ed0023-bed9-5848-9b85-d5026fe1404f"))
  (embedded_fonts no)
)
